pve-snapshot-api (0.2.0-1) stable; urgency=high

  * Fix scoped ACL evaluation, task authorization and cluster request routing.
  * Safely reconcile native ZFS clone dependencies and interrupted copies.
  * Persist task results and validate storage configuration before mutations.
  * Harden TLS, request limits and configuration; upgrade to Go 1.27.1.
  * Add native ZFS regression tests and verified multi-architecture releases.

